{"title":"Aug 7 — Busan → Seoul","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 7 — Busan → Seoul"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Friday · August 7, 2026 · Day 13 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Busan → Seoul 🚄</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 KTX · Seoul Forest · Seongsu Food Crawl · Last Shopping Day · Seoul</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug07\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug07').setView([37.5446, 127.0570], 13);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Shilla Stay Seodaemun Seoul Station', lat:37.5572, lng:126.9680, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla+Stay+Seodaemun+Seoul+Station' },\n    { name:'Seoul Forest 🌳', lat:37.5446, lng:127.0378, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seoul+Forest' },\n    { name:'Seongsu · Ggupdang 🍰', lat:37.5446, lng:127.0574, c:'#E53935', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ggupdang+Seongsu+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Rafre Fruit Dessert Cafe 🍓', lat:37.5448, lng:127.0580, c:'#AB47BC', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rafre+Fruit+Dessert+Cafe+Seongsu+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Soil & Tree ☕', lat:37.5445, lng:127.0575, c:'#8B6914', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Soil+Tree+Seongsu+Seoul' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — KTX to Seoul</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card transport\" data-dt=\"2026-08-07T10:30\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">10:00–11:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag transport\">🚄 KTX</span><span class=\"tag note\">Buy in advance</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">KTX: Busan Station → Seoul Station</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">High-speed train from Busan to Seoul. Target departure between 10:00–11:00 AM. Journey time ~2h 15m. Buy tickets on the Korail website or at the station. Busan KTX station is at Busan Station (city centre).\n      <ul>\n        <li>Check <a href=\"https://www.korail.com\" target=\"_blank\">korail.com</a> for tickets</li>\n        <li>Seat reservations recommended — window seat for scenery</li>\n        <li>Arrive Seoul ~12:30–13:00</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Busan+Station+KTX\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Busan Station</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/부산역+KTX\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Check In & Seongsu</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card activity\" data-dt=\"2026-08-07T13:00\" data-lat=\"37.5572\" data-lng=\"126.9680\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">BOOKED ✓</span><span class=\"tag activity\">🏨 Check-in</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Check In — Shilla Stay Seodaemun Seoul Station</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Return to Shilla Stay for final 3 nights (Aug 7–9). Breakfast included — CAFE B1F (weekdays 06:30–09:30). Drop luggage and head to Seongsu.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Shilla Stay+Seodaemun+Seoul+Station\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Shilla Stay Seodaemun</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/쉐라톤스테이서울역\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-07T15:00\" data-lat=\"37.5446\" data-lng=\"127.0378\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">15:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌳 Park</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Seoul Forest</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Urban forest park with deer, wetlands, and outdoor art. Great for a relaxing post-train walk through greenery.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seoul+Forest\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Seoul Forest</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/서울숲\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card shopping\" data-dt=\"2026-08-07T16:00\" data-lat=\"37.5446\" data-lng=\"127.0574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag shopping\">🛍️ Last Shopping</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Seongsu — Trendy Boutique District</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Seoul's Brooklyn — converted warehouses turned into independent boutiques, concept stores, and cafes. Great for unique finds and designer Korean brands.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Seongsu+shopping+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Seongsu</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/성수동+쇼핑\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Food Crawl — Seongsu</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-07T17:00\" data-lat=\"37.5446\" data-lng=\"127.0574\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">17:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍰 Bakery</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Ggupdang Seongsu</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Popular Seongsu bakery known for crispy pastry cream buns. Usually has a queue — get there early or during off-peak hours.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ggupdang+Seongsu+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Ggupdang</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/끕당+성수\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-07T17:30\" data-lat=\"37.5448\" data-lng=\"127.0580\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">17:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍓 Dessert</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Rafre Fruit Dessert Cafe Seongsu</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Seasonal fruit dessert cafe — elaborate fruit tarts, fruit shaved ice, and fruit-forward drinks. Beautiful and photogenic.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rafre+Fruit+Dessert+Cafe+Seongsu\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Rafre</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/라프레+과일디저트카페+성수\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-07T18:00\" data-lat=\"37.5445\" data-lng=\"127.0575\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">18:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">☕ Cafe</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Soil & Tree</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Specialty coffee and natural-focused cafe in the Seongsu area.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Soil+Tree+cafe+Seongsu+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Soil & Tree</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/소일앤트리+성수\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Only 2 more full days in Korea!</strong> Tomorrow: COEX, K-pop buildings, and final shopping. Plan your last must-buys tonight.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Friday · August 7, 2026 · Day 13 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Busan → Seoul 🚄</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 KTX · Seoul Forest · Seongsu Food Crawl · Last Shopping Day · Seoul</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug07\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug07').setView([37.5446, 127.0570], 13);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"><